    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >about this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a satirical idle-roguelite where you run a cult from your phone through social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy apps. swipe your way to followers. ascend for bigger, faster gains. then start again with permanent upgrades, sillier strategies, and fully automated pipelines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >what you do</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >download apps like <strong>faithbook</strong>, <strong>instagrim</strong>, <strong>hypnoscroll</strong>, <strong>ubabble</strong>\u2026 and plenty more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play small cozy minigames to grow your cult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect <strong>faith, cash, followers, and divinity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlock automation so the apps run themselves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ascend, earn cultivation points, and make the next run smoother</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >why it feels good</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short runs, 5\u201310 minutes, or leave it running in the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple paths to progress, with room for big swings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cozy humor and light satire, never too serious</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no true ending. just higher numbers. a stronger phone. a stranger cult.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cozy. goofy. incremental. just let the numbers climb.</p>",
